:: OC Kade School Pick Up Encounter [nobr]

/* Intro */
You walk out into the bus waiting area and yawn, the sudden burst of a cool breeze causing you too feel a little nappy. You stretch your arms into the air, yawning again, as you glance around the pick up area. The bus has yet to arrive, but a few parents have and pull up one at a time to pick up their kid. You wonder why some parents pick up their kids at school, rather than just take the bus. It’s not like the bus doesn’t go everywhere, since it basically stops at every neighborhood in town and then some. <span style="Color: Yellow">It is as you are pondering this that you see a very nice, shining black car pull up!</span> <br>
<br>
You gasp at the car, knowing just from the look and design of it that it must cost a fortune! It has a sleek, modern design and you can’t see a single defect or scratch on its body A few other boys notice as well, whistling or leaning in to get a closer look. You half expect <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> to walk up, despite knowing the car he is often picked up in is white, <span style="Color: Yellow">but instead can’t believe your eyes when a different kid shyly walks up!</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "OC Kade",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Sad",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span>, the quiet boy you met before, rushing up to the car and quickly gets inside, hiding his face behind his bag with a slight blush. He looks embarrassed and upset to be getting picked up, which you can’t imagine based on how nice that car looks! But, then again, it does put all eyes on him, which you’d guess is something the boy isn’t a big fan of, judging by how he crouches down low as soon as he is in the car, trying to avoid the gaze of all his impressed and surprised classmates. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kade</span>’s family must be loaded! <br>
<br>
